\f0\b \cf0 Short-Term Context (The Window):
\f1\b0  You always send the 
\f0\b last 5\'9610 messages
\f1\b0  in order. This allows the AI to handle pronouns (e.g., User: "What about this one?" AI knows "this one" refers to the snack mentioned 1 bubble ago).\
\
\
\uc0\u55357 \u56481 
\f0\b  Implementation Tip: "Summary" Embeddings\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 Instead of embedding every tiny "Hello" or "Thanks," a "Senior" approach is to have a background task (or an AI step every 5 messages) that 
\f0\b summarizes
\f1\b0  the user's preferences (e.g., "User likes spicy, hates matcha, allergic to peanuts") and embeds 
\f3\i that summary
\f1\i0  as a "Preference Profile." This is much more accurate for e-commerce than searching individual bubbles.\
\
\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 A. The "Message" Embedding (Granular)\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 Keep the embedding column on your messages table. This is for 
\f0\b Semantic Search
\f1\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Use Case:
\f1\b0  The user asks, "What was that blue snack we talked about 20 minutes ago?"\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Action:
\f1\b0  You search the messages table for the word "blue" or "snack" using vectors. It finds the specific bubble where you mentioned the "Blueberry Mochi."\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 B. The "Preference Profile" (Summarized)\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 This is a separate table or a JSONB column on the chats table. Every 5\'9610 messages, you ask a "hidden" AI prompt: 
\f3\i "Based on this chat, list the user's permanent preferences."
\f1\i0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f2\fs18 \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Example Summary:
\f1\b0  \{"likes": ["spicy", "crunchy"], "dislikes": ["matcha"], "allergies": ["peanuts"]\}.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f2\fs18 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b\fs26 Why embed this?
\f1\b0  You embed this summary so that the next time the user returns (tracked by your cookie), you can instantly find products that match this "Profile" without reading their old chat history.\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\
